# Sales planning, step 1: a target

A sales plan covers a period, such as a quarter, and has a target: how much you aim to sell. The target is expected, so a plan without one is flagged, and the condition on EndDate flags a period that ends before it starts.

```bss
t SalesPlan|usl
    A sales plan for a period: what you aim to sell.
    s+                          Name|Plan|e.g. "Sales Q4 2026"
    dd                          StartDate|Starts|The first day of the period
    dd|(EndDate >= StartDate)   EndDate|Ends|The last day of the period
    n+|0..                      Target|Target|How much you aim to sell in the period
```
